      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "二阶导数",
          "steps": [
            "$f(x) = (\\beta + x^{1/3})^2$",
            "$f'(x) = 2(\\beta + x^{1/3}) \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}x^{-2/3} = \\frac{2(\\beta + x^{1/3})}{3x^{2/3}}$",
            "$f''(x) = \\frac{2}{3}\\left[\\frac{\\frac{1}{3}x^{-2/3} \\cdot x^{2/3} - (\\beta + x^{1/3}) \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}x^{-5/3}}{x^{4/3}}\\right]$",
            "化简得：$f''(x) = \\frac{2}{9x^{2/3}} - \\frac{4\\beta}{9x^{5/3}}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
